# NORTHWELL: Network Optimized Routing & Telemetry Hub // Super Intelligence

An open-source technical architecture focused on building highly resilient, autonomous networking infrastructures. 

## Project Architecture & Intent
This codebase provides the foundational modules for routing table optimization and decentralized network telemetry collection. 

**This is an independent, non-commercial open-source sandbox. It is entirely unrelated to, unaffiliated with, and distinct from any clinical healthcare entity or hospital network.**

## Core Components
- `TelemetryHubRouter`: Core packet path resolution mapping engine.
- `TelemetryMetricsRegistry`: Event taxonomy tracking daemon.

